**2. See a small allocation cause an out-of-bounds write**

Open [allocation.c](/Users/noah/.codex/.chatgpt-projects/g-p-6aabfffb9fac81918b0494e56b90aa3a/overflow-lab/allocation.c).

This example deliberately stores a size in `uint8_t`, an unsigned 8-bit type:

```c
const unsigned int count = 65;
