```text
65 items × 4 bytes = 260 bytes needed
                         ↓
                Stored size becomes 4
                         ↓
                  malloc(4)
                         ↓
              Loop tries writing 260 bytes
```

Compile with memory checking enabled:

```sh
cc -std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -g -O0 \
